sub:assertion {
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/levin-2023-goals-13> delphi:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/levin-2023-goals-13--grok> .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/levin-2023-goals-13--grok> a delphi:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Grok 4.7 on levin-2023-goals-13: needs-new-data, resolvability 0.33" ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/dataset-resolvability-0.2.0> ;
    delphi:assessmentType "dataset-resolvability/0.2.0" ;
    delphi:hasScore "0.33"^^xsd:double ;
    delphi:hasVerdict "needs-new-data" ;
    delphi:hasConfidence "0.58"^^xsd:double ;
    dct:description "The planarian version of the prediction is measurable, but the only quantitative series is this paper's own aggregate, and the supplementary file is a document of figures rather than a reusable cohort table. Independent long-term imaging after a scored stable phenotype is not in a public dataset. Re-reading the paper's figure is not a test of the prediction." ;
    rdfs:comment "Proposed test with existing data: Follow individual regenerating or developing animals after an apparently stable phenotype and record whether anatomy changes again without a new intervention, using the planarian cutoff of any morphology change after four weeks. Repeated independent cohorts in which a non-trivial fraction remodel after long stability would support the prediction; large cohorts followed well past that window with no late change would count against it." ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/agent/delphisci-resolvability-assessor-grok-4.7-high-fast> ;
    delphi:evidenceAgainst "The wording is that something similar may occur, so failure to see late remodelling does not refute it.", "No public animal-level longitudinal morphology table covers the weeks after apparent regenerative completion.", "Late change can be produced by starvation, infection, or residual drug rather than an intrinsic return to an anatomical trajectory." .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/levin-2023-goals-13--grok--operationalizability> a delphi:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Operationalizability of levin-2023-goals-13 by Grok 4.7: 0.55" ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/dataset-resolvability-0.2.0-operationalizability> ;
    delphi:assessmentType "dataset-resolvability/0.2.0/operationalizability" ;
    delphi:hasScore "0.55"^^xsd:double ;
